    "learnings": {
      "repo": [
        "Heap budget is implemented in crates/semantic/src/heap.rs (298 lines): mimalloc committed bytes are checked before each component and every 32 steps (checker request or type conversion), including mid-conversion, which stops runaway growth on Chakra.",
